{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/about/[slug]/page,_N_T_/about/2026-02-24-the-future-is-yet-to-come"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/about/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/about/$d$slug","/about","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--Q5K0UX1dTfp8SZPg_L6Wj--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.15008bfb.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/330a17ddee87f907.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/806bdb8e4a6a9b95.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3a7ba59533961d35.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d702a24e2b6c48fa.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-53420ca41719f304.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/7c92e96509cd355e.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Personal Portfolio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Crafting code, capturing light, and making some noise.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5901b7c6-module__ec5Qua__variable jetbrains_mono_8be3b53a-module__CxiPNW__variable antialiased relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 pointer-events-none grainy opacity-20\"></div><main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\"><header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\"><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">[</span><span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase\">&lt; Back</span><span class=\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">]</span></span></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><h1 class=\"text-[10px] md:text-xs font-normal tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-500 uppercase\">Monologue</h1></div><div class=\"flex justify-end invisible md:visible\"><div class=\"w-16\"></div></div></header><main class=\"pt-48 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><header class=\"mb-24 space-y-8\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">FEBRUARY 24, 2026</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-100 leading-tight uppercase\">The future is yet to come</h1><div class=\"w-12 h-px bg-neutral-800\"></div></header><article class=\"prose prose-invert max-w-none\"><div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light space-y-12 whitespace-pre-wrap\">My mom asked me why I suddenly decided not to start working right after graduation.I told her:\n\n“Why not? I love the feeling of having options.I want to get into Big Tech—the money is great. But then again, maybe not—it’s exhausting, and I’d probably lose my hair to the grind. I want to be a Product Manager; the sense of achievement from building something is huge. But then again, maybe not—dealing with a hundred different personalities and playing the peacemaker sounds like a drag.\n\nI want to make films, maybe join a top-tier production house like MediaStorm. I want to be a creator, like the guys at Speedster. I even want to build rockets from scratch in a backyard workshop.\n\nI want to be a photographer, join a film crew, drive race cars for a factory team, or be a designer. I want to make music—play guitar in a dive bar and sing whatever song I’m obsessed with lately, not giving a damn whether the crowd is listening or not.\n\nI just suddenly realized: if I finish a Master’s degree and just start climbing the corporate ladder, my life is basically set in stone. Sure, I’ll make plenty of money and settle down in a big city, but I’ll lose my choices. The cost of turning back will be too high. Kids need school, and a wife might be shouting about divorce every time she’s unhappy. Good God!\n\nI just want to grab it all while I’m young: the best views, the best girls, the best version of myself, and the best opportunities.”\n\nMy Mom: 😮</div></article><footer class=\"mt-32 pt-16 border-t border-neutral-900 flex justify-end items-center\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-700 tracking-widest uppercase\">End of Passage</div></footer></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/