designer. I want to make music—play guitar in a dive bar and sing whatever song I’m obsessed with lately, not giving a damn whether the crowd is listening or not.\n\nI just suddenly realized: if I finish a Master’s degree and just start climbing the corporate ladder, my life is basically set in stone. Sure, I’ll make plenty of money and settle down in a big city, but I’ll lose my choices. The cost of turning back will be too high. Kids need school, and a wife might be shouting about divorce every time she’s unhappy. Good God!\n\nI just want to grab it all while I’m young: the best views, the best girls, the best version of myself, and the best opportunities.”\n\nMy Mom: 😮4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"href\":\"/about\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\",\"children\":\"[\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"tracking-widest uppercase\",\"children\":\"< Back\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\",\"children\":\"]\"}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] md:text-xs font-normal tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-500 uppercase\",\"children\":\"Monologue\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-end invisible md:visible\",\"children\":[\"